Proten Agents will have access to the following driver data
Categories of data they will access
 Name;
 Profile Picture;
 ID Card;
 Driving Licence;
 Gender;
 Birthday;
 Contact Details;
 Residence;
 Display Name;
 Username;
 Comment;
 Car;
 Orders;
 Balance(To confirm why driver is not receiving cash rides);
 Driverscore; and
 Scheduled Blocking;

*Discovery Effort estimates*
This is a tricky one, as the technical solution isn’t obvious to infer without a proper scope-out, there are different options we should consider. But everything should be on Discovery, nothing on Selection.

Let’s re-estimate after the scope out & design doc phase.

