*Effort estimates*
Heavy lifting is on Product & Design to map out all quadzillion variations we might have and to then to decide how we want to solve them.

Engineering heavy lifting is on Selection (cc [~accountid:636bb9ed11c69c741845530c] ), to e.g:

* make sure “out of delivery radius” and “out of provider delivery polygon” providers are handled in different “discovery tools” (Home Screen, Search) correctly
* correctly calculate the availability of the providers

Discovery, by definition, will just have to display whatever provider the Selection team returns in a nice UI.

