*Effort estimates*

It’s another tricky one, as it will rely a lot on the details on requirements – e.g. what kind of filters will we have to support? Definitely requires Selection support (cc [~accountid:636bb9ed11c69c741845530c] )

* if we limit us only to {{tags}} and {{traits}}, then we can probably reuse the existing {{Filter Type}} logic on {{Screen}} settings we have, making the BE part easier
* if we want something more dynamic (e.g. {{Has discounts?}}, {{Delivery price < 2€}}, {{ETA < 10 min}}, {{searchQuery = I'm loving it}}) then it becomes a lot more complex and the technical performance becomes a concern.

As it’s around the same are as [https://taxify.atlassian.net/browse/FOODDIS-141|https://taxify.atlassian.net/browse/FOODDIS-141|smart-link], then we’d have to tackle these one after another, preferably Segments first.

