In the local development we can add custom logic for the overlay for runtime errors:
[https://webpack.js.org/configuration/dev-server/#overlay|https://webpack.js.org/configuration/dev-server/#overlay|smart-link] 
Sth like:

{noformat}runtimeErrors: (error) => {
    if (error.name === "MissingPermissionsError" || error.name === "SERVER_ERROR") {
        return false;
    }
    return true;
},{noformat}

which will disable overlay. Then a user sees a notification popup that contains an error_hint which is more descriptive.
Other option would be to include {{error_hint}} in the overlay, but this needs some exploration how it can be achieved in the Devserver. I haven’t found a solution for that.

